  "verificationNotes": [
    "The first full run passed 763/764; the existing shutdown test rejected ECONNRESET from the intentional forced shutdown. Its event waiter now permits that reset while still requiring actual socket closure and same-port HTTP restart within the original deadlines. Focused shutdown and the full 764-test rerun pass. The failed log is retained.",
    "The first joined-run attempt had a duplicate local variable name and failed before starting a service. The name was corrected and both later joined runs pass.",
    "Actual producer HTTP replies are discarded; actual SQLite is closed/reopened. Concurrent recovery produces one immutable original decision without renewed admission. A separate request is stopped before reaching PWCE and remains unknown on lookup.",
    "A real original admission deadline expires before recovery. Historical lookup succeeds with unchanged expiry; canonical authorizeDispatch still rejects the expired decision. Host refusal, foreign session and producer revocation are independently checked.",
    "No selected-model qualification ran; historical SYNPRJ_Q7M4 telemetry remains unchanged and nonblocking."
  ],
